  "title": "Unique Bouncy Norwegian Split Peas Stew",
  "description": "A peppery and romantic Norwegian dish featuring split peas, this stew is a unique blend of flavors and textures, made with katsuramuki-cut vegetables for a special touch, and is jain-friendly.",
