  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the katsuramuki-cut onion, carrot, and celery, and cook until they are tender.",
    "Add the split peas, vegetable broth, black pepper, and salt to the pot.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 30 minutes.",
    "Use an immersion blender to puree the stew to the desired consistency.",
    "Serve the stew hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired."
